Package: statlearnfapaca
Type: Package
Title: Proteomics biomarker discovery for individualized prevention of familial pancreatic cancer using statistical learning
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given   = "Chung Shing Rex",
           family  = "Ha",
           role    = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email   = "hachungshingrex@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5238-0963")))
Description: R code of the simulation study and of the analysis of the FaPaCa
    proteomics data in the manuscript 'Proteomics biomarker discovery for
    individualized prevention of familial pancreatic cancer using statistical
    learning' (Ha et al., 2023) <doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0280399>. It compares
    ridge regression, adaptive lasso and boosting, and uses complementary pairs
    stability selection.
URL: https://github.com/csrexha/StatLearn_FaPaCa
